1
00:00:00,614 --> 00:00:03,014
I woke up early today, for once.

2
00:00:03,014 --> 00:00:05,104
Being an early-bird feels great, doesn't it?

3
00:00:05,104 --> 00:00:05,994
It sure does!

4
00:00:05,994 --> 00:00:08,414
A rifle Blaze?

5
00:00:08,414 --> 00:00:10,334
Are you sure you're not mistaken?

6
00:00:10,794 --> 00:00:13,774
I'm sure. That was definitely a Blaze.

7
00:00:23,144 --> 00:00:29,114
But Blazes aren't supposed to be able
 to materialize as complex weaponry...

8
00:00:30,254 --> 00:00:32,354
Maybe that's why people say she's special...

9
00:00:32,354 --> 00:00:34,354
The reason she's an "Exception."

10
00:00:35,154 --> 00:00:36,634
An "Exception"?

11
00:00:38,744 --> 00:00:40,444
Even then...

12
00:00:41,314 --> 00:00:43,914
Lilith's absent again today, huh?

13
00:00:51,834 --> 00:00:54,384
The "Exception" and the "Irregular"...

14
00:00:56,674 --> 00:00:58,884
This is fate...

15
00:00:58,884 --> 00:01:00,594
Kokonoe Tooru.

