Not bad.

3191
00:12:02,874 --> 00:12:08,884
Tooru-san

3192
00:12:02,874 --> 00:12:08,884
Tooru-san

3193
00:12:02,874 --> 00:12:08,884
Lilith-san

3194
00:12:02,874 --> 00:12:08,884
Lilith-san

