The fact that there was another "Unrivaled" Blaze user...

3207
00:12:57,394 --> 00:12:59,054
It got me excited.

3208
00:12:59,564 --> 00:13:03,184
To know that I'm not the only one in this world.

3209
00:13:04,084 --> 00:13:05,584
And I felt that...

3210
00:13:06,334 --> 00:13:09,944
My Duo partner couldn't be
 anyone but you, the "Irregular."

3211
00:13:10,984 --> 00:13:12,564
No one but me...?

3212
00:13:12,564 --> 00:13:13,944
That's...

3213
00:13:19,194 --> 00:13:21,564
My gun shoots down our enemies.

3214
00:13:21,564 --> 00:13:23,754
Your shield fends off their blades.

3215
00:13:24,384 --> 00:13:27,304
Yes, you're just like a guardian knight.

3216
00:13:28,304 --> 00:13:29,304
That's why...

3217
