That's why my feelings won't ever change.

3238
00:16:29,134 --> 00:16:32,264
You've turned me down twice now.

3239
00:16:32,264 --> 00:16:33,894
I won't ever forgive you.

3240
00:16:45,044 --> 00:16:47,534
Looks like she hates me now.

3241
