Actually, she asked me to form a Duo with her once before.

3242
00:16:52,144 --> 00:16:54,074
But I didn't want to make you worry.

3243
00:16:54,714 --> 00:16:57,544
I'm sorry for not telling you something so important.

3244
00:16:58,594 --> 00:17:03,534
Nei. You have your own way of doing things.

3245
00:17:03,534 --> 00:17:05,054
