3256
00:17:48,774 --> 00:17:51,514
I wonder if Kokonoe-kun came back already...

3257
00:17:52,184 --> 00:17:55,044
Miyabi. Isn't it time for your bath?

3258
00:17:55,894 --> 00:17:56,674
Okay.

3259
