U-Um...

3262
00:18:10,404 --> 00:18:12,994
This isn't a changing room...

3263
00:18:12,994 --> 00:18:13,614
Huh?

3264
00:18:14,664 --> 00:18:15,584
Oh...

3265
00:18:16,464 --> 00:18:20,584
Y-You're right! What am I doing?

3266
00:18:31,684 --> 00:18:33,604
<i>This isn't fair...</i>

3267
00:18:34,824 --> 00:18:35,854
All right!

3268
00:18:35,854 --> 00:18:39,804
Now that those who skipped class yesterday have been punished,

3269
00:18:39,804 --> 00:18:41,484
I have an announcement to make!

3270
00:18:41,874 --> 00:18:46,074
We'll be having an interclass battle with the second years soon.

3271
00:18:46,074 --> 00:18:47,614
We call it...

3272
00:18:47,614 --> 00:18:49,354
The Dragon's Bite Battle!

3273
00:18:47,694 --> 00:18:50,244
Dragon's

3274
00:18:47,694 --> 00:18:50,244
Dragon's

3275
00:18:48,204 --> 00:18:50,244
Bite

3276
00:18:48,204 --> 00:18:50,244
Bite

3277
00:18:48,704 --> 00:18:50,244
Battle

3278
