The Dragon's Bite Battle?

3280
00:18:56,754 --> 00:18:57,794
However...

3281
00:18:57,794 --> 00:18:59,964
You won't be fighting as Duos this time.

3282
00:18:59,964 --> 00:19:02,494
It will be first years against second years.

3283
00:19:02,494 --> 00:19:06,464
The first years will take on a few chosen second year members.

3284
00:19:11,994 --> 00:19:14,634
Having you all participate gives you the advantage...

3285
00:19:14,634 --> 00:19:16,154
If you think that, you're naÃ¯ve.

3286
00:19:16,154 --> 00:19:17,674
Way too naÃ¯ve!

3287
00:19:17,674 --> 00:19:21,314
The second years are all either Level 2 or Level 3.

3288
00:19:21,314 --> 00:19:25,964
In other words, there are several of them that are as strong as me.

3289
00:19:27,434 --> 00:19:32,324
Which means, if you don't come up with a good plan, they'll cut you to bits!

3290
00:19:32,324 --> 00:19:34,194
Good luck, everyone!

3291
