If we're doing this, we may as well take on the strongest of them.

3296
00:19:47,644 --> 00:19:51,554
Ja. We're also stronger than we were before.

3297
00:19:51,554 --> 00:19:54,474
Hmph. No matter what level my opponents are,

3298
00:19:54,474 --> 00:19:56,634
