What is she...?

3304
00:20:14,974 --> 00:20:16,204
Lilith!

3305
00:20:16,604 --> 00:20:21,464
Sorry to interrupt, but could we start the Dragon's Bite Battle right now?

3306
00:20:22,204 --> 00:20:26,214
I'll take you all on as the representative for the first years.

3307
00:20:26,214 --> 00:20:28,424
