3309
00:20:30,514 --> 00:20:32,724
You're not making any sense!

3310
00:20:33,484 --> 00:20:36,224
Okay then, maybe this will make it more clear.

3311
00:20:43,274 --> 00:20:45,484
A rifle Blaze?

3312
00:20:48,304 --> 00:20:52,984
All right. Who wants to be hunted next?

