00:22:17,914 --> 00:22:18,214
Someday let's be even more happy, happy

7924
00:22:31,004 --> 00:22:33,014
What a girl...

7925
00:22:33,504 --> 00:22:35,264
This is a problem.

7926
00:22:38,924 --> 00:22:41,134
Even if you are an "Exception,"

7927
00:22:41,134 --> 00:22:45,024
to ruin the Dragon's Bite Battle
 I'd worked so hard to put together...

7928
00:22:45,484 --> 00:22:47,104
Don't worry.

7929
00:22:47,104 --> 00:22:52,404
In exchange, I'll host a dance party to deepen my relationship with my classmates.

7930
00:22:52,864 --> 00:22:56,234
It is I, as the host, who will take care of them.

7931
00:22:56,234 --> 00:23:01,074
The dress code will be "Blaze," 
and our dancing swords will supply the tune.

7932
00:23:02,574 --> 00:23:05,834
You want to take on the entire class by yourself?

7933
00:23:05,834 --> 00:23:09,584
Wow! That little princess is one hell of a wild horse!

7934
00:23:10,354 --> 00:23:13,634
The dance shall be called... let's see...

7935
00:23:19,714 --> 00:23:23,264
Survival Battle: "Survive."

7936
00:23:25,744 --> 00:23:27,394
A rifle Blaze...

7937
00:23:27,394 --> 00:23:30,154
Just like me, a one-of-a-kind: "Unrivaled."

7938
00:23:30,154 --> 00:23:31,544
We'll need to be careful.

7939
00:23:31,544 --> 00:23:33,434
Ja. I know.

7940
00:23:33,434 --> 00:23:34,754
I'll bring her down.

7941
00:23:34,754 --> 00:23:35,734
Julie?

7942
00:23:35,734 --> 00:23:37,484
Next time: Survive.

